<header class="panel hero" style="text-align:left; padding-block: var(--space-8) var(--space-6);">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
    <h1 style="font-size: var(--step-h2);">What This Site Collects (And What It Doesn't)</h1>
    <p class="panel__lede">Last updated {{ build.formatted }}. Written in plain language on purpose, the same way this whole page argues a privacy policy should be.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="panel">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="a11y-list">
      <div class="a11y-list__item">
        <span class="a11y-list__tag">USES</span>
        <p>This site uses two analytics tools: <strong>Google Analytics</strong> (which pages get visited, roughly how people found them, general device and browser type) and <strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong> (mouse movement, clicks, scrolling, and anonymized session recordings, shown back as heatmaps). Both exist to show what's actually useful on this page and what people skip.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="a11y-list__item">
        <span class="a11y-list__tag">COOKIES</span>
        <p>Yes, this site uses cookies, small files those two tools set in your browser to tell one visit apart from another. No account or login is tied to them. You can block or clear them anytime in your browser's settings without breaking anything here. (More on what a cookie actually is in the <a href="/dictionary/cookie/">dictionary</a>.)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="a11y-list__item">
        <span class="a11y-list__tag">NOT</span>
        <p>No accounts, no logins, no personal profiles are built. Nothing is sold to anyone. Neither tool is used for ad targeting, and nothing here follows you to other sites the way third-party ad trackers do.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="a11y-list__item">
        <span class="a11y-list__tag">STORAGE</span>
        <p>Your dark mode preference and quiz progress live in your browser's local storage, not a cookie. They're never sent to a server; they just stay on your device so the setting sticks the next time you visit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="a11y-list__item">
        <span class="a11y-list__tag">CONTACT</span>
        <p>Questions about this page or its data practices can go through <a href="https://www.creativepea.com">creativepea.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="callout" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
      <p>This site is a free educational project, not a business collecting data for profit. This policy will stay this short because there genuinely isn't more to disclose. If that ever changes, this page changes with it.</p>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top: 2rem;"><a href="/">← Back to Webpage Anatomy</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
